title: 12V Power Outlet (Power Point) Timeout Duration
raw_community_title: Power Point Timeout Duration (in seconds converted to hex) (2021-2026)
category: Convenience and Electrical
platform: F-150
model_years: 2021-2026
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
steps:
- module: BCM
  address: 726-57-01
  mask: '**** xxxx xx--'
  type: continuous
  unit: seconds
  feature_name: Power_Point_Maxtime_Cfg (PPMC)
  instruction: 0001=1 second, 600=10 minutes, 1800=30 minutes, 3600=1hr. Ensure Power
    Point Timeout is not disabled.  Longer times possible (use calculator)
